---

Purpose

The Ohira Core Engine is responsible for orchestrating every analysis performed by the platform.

It coordinates:

Project discovery

Plugin execution

Data collection

Knowledge graph generation

Report generation

AI context generation

Incremental updates

Caching

Error recovery


The Core Engine should remain framework-agnostic, lightweight, and extensible.


---

Core Responsibilities

The Core Engine must:

Discover projects

Load configuration

Load plugins

Execute analysis pipeline

Build the Knowledge Graph

Generate reports

Generate AI Context

Expose results to APIs and CLI


It must never contain technology-specific logic.


